                    <xsd:element name="KeepSpotRateFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
        Indicates whether an existing spot rate for the load should be retained. Must not be true if UncommitFlag is also true. 
