                  A collection of freight bills.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FreightBillCreateMode" type="cis:FreightBillIdCreateModeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                  The freight bill create mode. Optional. 
                  An enumerated value defining different freight bill create modes which control how the division and logistics group of the freight bill will be set.
                  Possible values are FBCM_DEFAULT, FBCM_USE_VCHR_DIV_MANDATORY and FBCM_USE_VCHR_DIV_BEST_EFFORT.
                  When its value is FBCM_USE_VCHR_DIV_MANDATORY, the division and logistics group from a matching voucher based on the reference number of 
                  the first freight bill detail will be used to create the freight bill. If a matching voucher is not found, the request will fail.
                  When it is FBCM_USE_VCHR_DIV_BEST_EFFORT, it will also try to use the division and logistics group from the matching voucher if one is found. 
                  If a matching voucher is not found, then it will fall back to use the default method.
                  The default method is to use the division and logistics group from the input if provided. If not, the values
                  will from the freight bill version of the user.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
