				The date of the drop-off.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CommodityNote" type="cis:NameType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Additional information about the stop.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="StopTypeEnumVal" type="cis:StopEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The pick and drop type of the stop.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="StopTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for stopTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PrimaryShippingLocationCode" type="cis:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The primary shipping location code. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PrimaryShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="cis:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The primary shipping location type. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PrimaryShippingLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for primaryShippingLocationTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IgnoreReferenceNumbersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicates whether referenceNumberStructure should be ignored. May be present for create and update operations.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ReferenceNumberStructure" type="cis:ReferenceNumberType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The NOF stop reference numbers.
                                ReferenceNumberAlternateStructure is not applicable for now
                                because with  current implementation, NOF stops will be recreated when NOF is updated.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="NonOperationalFreight" type="cis:NonOperationalFreightType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Associated non-operational freight.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="PrimaryPurgeParameterType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Primary Purge parameters. Substrutue of ScheduleRunType. Used only for 
				scheduled run creation of Primary Purge request.
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeModeEnumVal" type="cis:PurgeModeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The execution mode of this primary purge request. Mandatory.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="MaximumRunTime" type="cis:HoursType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The maximum run time  (in hours) allowed for this primary purge schedule run. 
					Zero means unlimited. Valid range is from 0 to 168.
					Defaulted to zero if omitted. Internally, it will be converted to minutes.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="MaximumBlockPerIteration" type="cis:MaximumPurgeBlockPerIterationType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The maximum number of purge blocks for each iteration.
					This number controls how big the temporary Delete Work file and 
					the output Sorted Purge Report will be. Zero means no limit. When the number 
					of Purge Blocks processed reaches this maximum value (non-zero), the Delete Work 
					file will be cleared, the current Sorted Purge Report will be flushed, and a new 
					one will be created (the new one after the initial one has the iteration number 
					as part of the Sorted Purge Report name).
					Valid range is from 0 to 999999. 
					Defaulted to zero if omitted.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeReportName" type="cis:ReportNameType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The purge report name. Default is PurgeReport.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeBlockDumpFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicates whether block dump should be created.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BlockDumpName" type="cis:ReportNameType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The file name for dumping a purge block if purgeBlockDumpFlag is on. Default to PurgeDump.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeEntityTypeEnumVal" type="cis:PurgeEntityTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The entity type for this primary purge. Indicating the site configuration of the purge. Mandatory.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EnforceIntegrityFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicates whether all loads, trips and shipments pulled into a Purge Block by the 
					initial load must match all purge parameters to be qualified for purging. Default to true.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DisregardFinancialStatusFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Applicable when purgeEntityTypeEnumVal is not Operational Only (i.e. PET_OPER_FIN_AP or PET_OPER_FIN_ARAP).
					Indicates whether the load is eligible for purge when no voucher has been created or 
					financial status needs to be checked.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="MinimumAPGLPurgeStatusEnumVal" type="cis:MinimumAPGLPurgeStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Applicable when purgeEntityTypeEnumVal is Operational with Financial A/P Only or 
					Operational with Financial A/P and A/R (i.e. PET_OPER_FIN_AP or PET_OPER_FIN_ARAP).
					The minimum status of the G/L Transactions of the load which the load will be eligible for purge when
					disregardFinancialStatusFlag is not true.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="MinimumARGLPurgeStatusEnumVal" type="cis:MinimumARGLPurgeStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Applicable when purgeEntityTypeEnumVal is Operational with Financial A/P and A/R (i.e. PET_OPER_FIN_ARAP).
					The minimum status of the G/L Transactions of the load which the load will be eligible for purge when
					disregardFinancialStatusFlag is not true.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeLoadId" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The single load ID if only one load to be purged.
					When purgeLoadId is specified, cutOffFromDate, cutOffToDate and cutOffAdjustmentDays will be ignored.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="MinimumLoadPurgeOperationalStatusEnumVal" type="cis:MinimumLoadPurgeOperationalStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The minimum operational status of the load which the load will be eligible for purge.
					Mandatory.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CustomerCode" type="cis:CustomerCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					When specified, only those loads with matching customer ID will be eligible for purge.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="cis:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					When specified, only those loads with matching division will be eligible for purge.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LogisticsGroupCode" type="cis:LogisticGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					When specified, only those loads with matching logistics group will be eligible for purge.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CutOffFromDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The From date of the cut off date range. 
					Loads with creation date within the cut off range are eligible for purge.
					Mandatory when purgeLoadId is not specified and cutOffAdjustmentDays is not specified.
					The Cutoff Adjustment Days and Cutoff Date From/To are mutually exclusive.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CutOffToDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The To date of the cut off date range. 
					Loads with creation date within the cut off range are eligible for purge.
					Mandatory when purgeLoadId is not specified and cutOffAdjustmentDays is not specified.
					The Cutoff Adjustment Days and Cutoff Date From/To are mutually exclusive.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CutOffAdjustmentDays" type="cis:CutOffAdjustmentDaysType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The number of days before today, which will be treated as the cutoff end date.
					Ten years or 3653 days from the cut off end date will be treated as the cut off start date.
					Load creation date falls within the date range will be eligible for purge. 
					Mandatory when purgeLoadId is not specified and Cutoff Date range is not specified.
					The Cutoff Adjustment Days and Cutoff Date From/To are mutually exclusive.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="RatingInformationType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Rating information details.
				</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="Id" type="cis:IDType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemUnitOfMeasureEnumVal" type="cis:SystemUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The unit of measurement.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemUnitOfMeasureEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for systemUnitOfMeasureEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="WeightUnitOfMeasureEnumVal" type="cis:WeightUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The unit of weight.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="WeightUnitOfMeasureEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for weightUnitOfMeasureEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LengthUnitOfMeasureEnumVal" type="cis:LengthUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The unit of length.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LengthUnitOfMeasureEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for lengthUnitOfMeasureEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DistanceUnitOfMeasureEnumVal" type="cis:DistanceUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The unit of distance.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DistanceUnitOfMeasureEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for distanceUnitOfMeasureEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CurrencyCode" type="cis:CurrencyDomainValueType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The currency type.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CurrencyCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for currencyCode. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ExchangeRate" type="cis:ExchangeRateType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The exchange rate.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SpotRateFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Indicates whether to use a spot rate.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SpotRateDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The spot rate date and time.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The rated date and time.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CostCenterCode" type="cis:CostCenterDomainValueType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The cost center type.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CostCenterCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for costCenterCode. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemCalculatedAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The system calculated amount.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DiscountAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The discount amount.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargedAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The charged amount.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FederalTaxAmount" type="cis:DollarType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The federal tax.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="StateTaxAmount" type="cis:DollarType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The state or provincial tax.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LocalTaxAmount" type="cis:DollarType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The local tax.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AdditionalChargesAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				an additional charge.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PreconsolidatedAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The pre-consolidated amount.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RateCode" type="cis:RateCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The rate code.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RateCodeTariffNumber" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The rate code tariff ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SpotRatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The spot rate user ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="TariffServiceCode" type="cis:ServiceCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The tariff service.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="TariffID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The tariff ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EquipmentTypeCode" type="cis:EquipmentTypeCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The trailer equipment type .
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="TractorEquipmentTypeCode" type="cis:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The tractor equipment type.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DomicileCode" type="cis:DomicileCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The tractor domicile code.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DomicileTrailerCode" type="cis:DomicileCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The trailer domicile code.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Distance" type="cis:DistanceType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The distance that the freight is being shipped.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CarrierCode" type="cis:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The carrier ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DistanceEngine" type="cis:ExternalEngineVersionCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The external engine version (distance engine) code. Read Only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Charge" type="cis:APChargeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The set of charges associated with the rating information.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="ScheduleRunType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
                Schedule Run parameters.
            </xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="RequestID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The request ID. Not used for Create. Mandatory for Update.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal" type="cis:ScheduleRunTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The type of the schedule run. Mandatory field for Create; ignored for Update.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="VersionCode" type="cis:ScheduleRunVersionCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The ID code of the version for the schedule run.
                    Optional for Create, defaulted from the current user profile if not supplied.
                    Ignored for Update.
                    Not applicable for Period Close and non-financial runs.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="StartDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The scheduled start date and time of the batch run. Optional. Default is current date and time.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AbortDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The scheduled abort date and time of the batch run. Optional.
                    Applicable only for updating schedule run for aborting the run.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Priority" type="cis:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The priority of the batch run in the queue. Optional. Default is 3. For Period Close, default is 5.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="JobName" type="cis:JobNameType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The Job Name. Jobs with the same job name must be executed sequentially. Optional field.
                    Input value ended with underscore is not allowed. Job Name with underscore will be reserved for internal system use.
                    Input value of this field for Primary Purge will be ignored.
                    For Primary Purge, it would be hard coded as PRIMARY_PURGE_.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal" type="cis:SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The supplementary purge type.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CutOffDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The cut-off date for a supplementary purge run.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActiveMessagesCutOffDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The supplementary purge cut-off date for active Event Notification entries.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_EVNT_NOTIF;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActiveAlertsCutOffDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The supplementary purge cut-off date for active alerts.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_MNTR_DATA;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActiveRateQuotationsCutOffDate" type="xsd:date" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The supplementary purge cut-off date for active Rate Quotations.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_RATE_QUOTE;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeNonOperationalFreightMinimumStatusEnumVal" type="cis:PurgeMinimumInterfaceStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The minimum interface status for supplementary purge of Non-Operational Freights.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_NOF;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeFreightBillInvoiceMinimumStatusEnumVal" type="cis:PurgeMinimumInterfaceStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The minimum interface status for supplementary purge of Freight Bills and Invoices.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_FRHT_INVC;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeCancelledShipmentsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether non-processed shipments in CANCELLED status should be purged.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_NONPROCESSED_SHPM;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgePendingShipmentsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether non-processed shipments in INIT (Pending) status should be purged.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_NONPROCESSED_SHPM;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeOpenProcessedShipmentsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether non-processed shipments in OPEN or PROCESSED status should be purged.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_NONPROCESSED_SHPM;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PurgeOrphanGLMinimumStatusEnumVal" type="cis:MinimumAPGLPurgeStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The minimum A/P G/L status of the orphan G/L transactions which will be purged.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_GL_ORPHAN_ENTRY; 
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DistanceEngine" type="cis:ExternalEngineVersionCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The external engine version (distance engine) codes for supplementary purge of cached distances.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_SUPPLPURGE and
                    SupplementaryPurgeTypeEnumVal is SPRG_DIST_CACHE;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="cis:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The division ID for business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS,
                    in this case it is mandatory when ZoneCode entries are not supplied;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ZoneCode" type="cis:ZoneCodeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The zone codes for business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS,
                    in this case at least one entry is required when DivisionCode is not supplied;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForNonRestrictedEntitiesFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether entities not restricted to a division should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForLoadAtsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether load-ats should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForConsigneesFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether consignees should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForHubsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether hubs should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForDistributionCentersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether distribution centers should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForDocksFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether docks should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForCustomersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether customers should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForCarriersFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether carriers should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForDomicilesFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether domiciles should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForGlobalDefaultsFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether global defaults should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForTariffServicesFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether tariff services should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForDeliverySchedulesFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether delivery schedules should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForBusinessHourZoneFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether business hour zones should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForItinerariesFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether Delivery Schedule Itineraries should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursForDriversFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates whether Assets should be included into business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BusinessHoursUpdateStrategyEnumVal" type="cis:BusinessHoursUpdateStrategyEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The strategy for business hours update.
                    Applicable and mandatory only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Holiday" type="cis:HolidayType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    New holidays (business hours exceptions) for business hours update.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_BUSHRS,
                    in this case at least one entry is required;
                    ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PrimaryPurgeParameter" type="cis:PrimaryPurgeParameterType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Parameters for primary purge request.
                    Applicable only for Create when
                    ScheduleRunTypeEnumVal is SRT_PRIMARYPURGE, ignored otherwise.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="VoucherChargeType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Voucher charges.

				(*) Units of measurement must be taken from the tariff associated with A/P or A/R voucher.
				</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="Id" type="cis:IDType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemChargeDetailID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The charge detail ID.
                                Must be empty for adjustment creation.
                                Mandatory for update. Not needed for create.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeLevelEnumVal" type="cis:ChargeLevelEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Service, condition or option.
                                Mandatory for adjustment creation. Not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeLevelEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for chargeLevelEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeDetailEnumVal" type="cis:ChargeDetailEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The charge detail type. Read only field.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeDetailEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for chargeDetailEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeCode" type="cis:ChargeCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The master charge code.
                                Conditional mandatory for adjustment creation, depends on ChargeLevelEnumValType.
                                Not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UnitTypeEnumVal" type="cis:UnitEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The unit type of the charge. Read only field.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UnitTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for unitTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LookupUnitsEnumVal" type="cis:UnitEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The lookup unit type of the charge. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LookupUnitsEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for lookupUnitsEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LookupUnits" type="cis:NumberOfUnitsWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The lookup unit. Rate only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RatedAsUnits" type="cis:NumberOfUnitsWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The rated unit. 
                                Updateable except for original charge, charge with status beyond accrued or 
                                corresponding customer surcharge already created. Update ignored otherwise.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeUnits" type="cis:NumberOfUnitsWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The charged unit. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ManualOverrideUnits" type="cis:NumberOfUnitsWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The manual override unit. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargedUnitRate" type="cis:RatePerUnitType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The charged unit rate. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UnitRate" type="cis:RatePerUnitType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The rate at which each unit is charged.
                                Updateable except for original charge, charge with status beyond accrued or 
                                corresponding customer surcharge already created. Update ignored otherwise.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargedAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The charged amount including any discount or surcharge.
					Updateable except for original charge, charge with status beyond accrued or
					corresponding customer surcharge already created. Ignored otherwise.
					Cannot be supplied if OriginalCurrencyGrossAmount is also present in the input.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PaymentAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The charged amount in payment currency. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="TotalTaxAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Reverse charge tax amount in rating currency. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FreightClassCode" type="cis:FreightClassCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The freight class ID. Conditional mandatory for create. Not updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ReasonCode" type="cis:AdjustmentReasonCodeDomainValueType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The reason code for the voucher charge. Mandatory and updateable.
                                Updateable except for original charge, charge with status beyond accrued or 
                                corresponding customer surcharge already created. Update ignored otherwise.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ReasonCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for reasonCode. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CustomerChargeGeneratedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Indicates whether the AR charge has been created or not. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeIsTaxFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Indicates whether the charge is a tax adjustment. Input only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ReverseChargeFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Indicates whether the tax adjustment is a reverse charge. Input only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeDetailAdjustEnumVal" type="cis:ChargeDetailAdjustEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The adjustment level. Mandatory for adjustment creation, not updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ChargeDetailAdjustEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for chargeDetailAdjustEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CurrentStatusEnumVal" type="cis:ChargeDetailStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The current status of the charge detail. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CurrentStatusEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for currentStatusEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The system shipment ID, if the AR charge detail is associated with a shipment.
                                Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemContainerID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The system container ID if the charge is associated with a container.
                                Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentLegID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The system shipment leg ID if the charge is associated with a shipment leg or shipment leg container.
                                Required for AP adjustment creation if voucher is at load level and the charge is for a specific shipment leg.
                                Not updateable. Read only otherwise.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The system load ID if the charge is associated with a load.
                                Required for AP adjustment creation if voucher is at trip level and the charge is for a specific load.
                                Not updateable. Read only otherwise.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentLegContainerID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The system shipment leg container ID if the charge is associated with a shipment leg container.
                                Required for AP adjustment creation if voucher is not at shipment leg container level and the charge is for a specific shipment leg container.
                                Not updateable. Read only otherwise.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemNonOperationalFreightAPID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The non operational freight ID if the charge is an AP charge of a Non Operational Freight.
                                Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemNonOperationalFreightARID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The non operational freight ID if the charge is an AR charge of a Non Operational Freight.
                                Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BasedSystemChargeDetailID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The charge detail ID which this charge is based upon, if the charge is surcharge based charge.
                                Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EquipmentTypeCode" type="cis:EquipmentTypeCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The equipment type code, if the charge is associated with an equipment type.
                                Updateable except for original charge, charge with status beyond accrued or 
                                corresponding customer surcharge already created. Update ignored otherwise.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="StopSequenceNumber" type="cis:UnsignedLongType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The stop sequence number from a load, if the charge is associated a shipping location.
                                Not updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ResponsibleCustomerEnumVal" type="cis:ResponsibleCustomerEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The responsible customer type.
                                Conditonal updateable depends on the values of chargeLevelEnumVal and chargeCode.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ResponsibleCustomerEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for responsibleCustomerEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ResponsibleCustomerCode" type="cis:CustomerCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The responsible customer code.
                                Conditonal updateable depends on the values of chargeLevelEnumVal, chargeCode and responsibleCustomerEnumVal.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Priority" type="cis:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The sequence of the charges. Read only.
                                Not updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OptionApplyLevelEnumVal" type="cis:OptionsAppliedEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                TThe option level applied to this charge. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OptionApplyLevelEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Description for optionApplyLevelEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DiscountAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The discount or surcharge amount. If negative, it is a discount. Read only.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RateRange" type="cis:NumberofUnitsType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The rate range for calculating the charge. Read only.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RatedAsFreightClassCode" type="cis:FreightClassCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The rated freight class. Not updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ShippingLocationCode" type="cis:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The ID of the shipping point of the shipping location charge. Not updateable.
                                From 8.0, this field can be used as input for adjustment creation related to 
                                a shipping location without stop.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="cis:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                        The type of shipping point for the shipping location charge. Read only.
	                                From 8.0, this field can be used as input for adjustment creation related to 
	                                a shipping location without stop.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Description for shippingLocationTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RatedAsEquipmentTypeCode" type="cis:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The code for Rated As Equipment Type. Read only.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="TripLevelChargeFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Indicates whether the AR charge has been created or not. Read only field.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AccruedExpenseOrRevenueGLAccountNumber" type="cis:GLAccountNumberType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Accrued expense account number.
                                Updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AccruedLiabilityOrAssetGLAccountNumber" type="cis:GLAccountNumberType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Accrued liability account number.
                                Updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ExpenseOrRevenueGLAccountNumber" type="cis:GLAccountNumberType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Expense account number.
                                Updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LiabilityOrAssetGLAccountNumber" type="cis:GLAccountNumberType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Liability account number.
                                Updateable.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PrePurchasedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicates whether the amounts are pre-purchased. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="VoucherChargeApprovalStatusEnumVal" type="cis:VoucherChargeApprovalStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The approval status for the voucher charge. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="VoucherChargeApprovalStatusEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Description for voucherChargeApprovalStatusEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
					</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ApprovalDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The date and time when the charge detail was approved. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ApprovalByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID of the user who approved the charge detail. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IsTaxFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicates whether the charge is a tax charge. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OriginalCurrencyCode" type="cis:CurrencyDomainValueType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The original currency. Updateable as long as amounts can be updated.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OriginalCurrencyCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Description for OriginalCurrencyCode. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OriginalCurrencyExchangeRate" type="cis:ExchangeRateType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The exchange rate for the original currency. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OriginalCurrencyGrossAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The gross amount in the original currency (prior to applying surcharge or discount).
					Updateable except for original charge, charge with status beyond accrued or
					corresponding customer surcharge already created. Ignored otherwise.
					Cannot be supplied if ChargedAmount is also present in the input.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OriginalCurrencyDiscountAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The surcharge/discount amount in original currency. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="OriginalCurrencyNetAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The net amount in original currency (after applying surcharge or discount). Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="TariffID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The system-generated tariff ID. Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedByRatingUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID of the user that created the charge detail (when charge detail was created based on a routing, rating and scheduling request). Read-only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The date and time the charge was created. This is read-only field.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The date and time the charge was updated. This is read-only field.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The user that created the charge. This is read-only field.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The user that last updated the charge. This is read-only field.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ExternalChargeCode" type="cis:ExternalChargeCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The external charge code for this charge detail (applicable only when charge is retrieved from an external source which supports detailed charges).
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Voucher" type="cis:APVoucherType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Associated A/P voucher.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ARVoucher" type="cis:ARVoucherType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Associated A/R voucher.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Tariff" type="cis:TariffType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Associated tariff.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="VoucherHeldLogType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Voucher held logs. Structure used for retrieval only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="Id" type="cis:IDType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemHeldLogID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The ID uniquely identifies the voucher held log.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="VoucherHeldReasonEnumVal" type="cis:VoucherHeldReasonEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The reason why the voucher is held.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="VoucherHeldReasonEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Description for voucherHeldReasonEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RatingConsolidationNumber" type="cis:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The rating consolidation reference number of a shipment, for AR voucher.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemAPVoucherID" type="cis:VoucherNumberType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The ID of the AP voucher that the held log belongs to.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemARVoucherID" type="cis:VoucherNumberType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The ID of the AR voucher that the held log belongs to.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentLegID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The system shipment leg ID if the voucher is associated with a shipment leg.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentLegContainerID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The system shipment leg container ID if the voucher is associated with a shipment leg container.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemChargeDetailID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The charge detail ID.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemNonOperationalFreightID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                The non operational freight ID if the voucher is associated with a non operational freight.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="APVoucher" type="cis:APVoucherType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Associated A/P voucher.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ARVoucher" type="cis:ARVoucherType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Associated A/R voucher.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="VoucherHoldStatusDataType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Voucher hold status data structure.
				</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemVoucherID" type="cis:VoucherNumberType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The ID uniquely identifies the voucher. Mandatory
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="HoldFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                                Indicates whether to hold the voucher or not. Mandatory.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="IntegrationBatchRequestType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Integration request, a batch request in the integration request queue.  
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="RequestID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			                The ID of the integration request. Ignore for create and mandatory for update and other operations.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ServerID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			                The internal ID of the server where the integration request is executed. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="QueuedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The date and time that the request was put onto the queue, i.e. request creation date and time. Read only field.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ScheduledDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The date and time that the request scheduled to be executed. Mandatory.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CompletedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The date and time that the batch request completed. Read only.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Priority" type="cis:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The priority of the batch run in the queue. Optional. Default is 3.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BatchRequestStatusEnumVal" type="cis:QueueStatusEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The integration request status. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BatchRequestStatusEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Description for BatchRequestStatusEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DisplayedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The displayed flag. Read only.
					Currently not in use.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The ID of the user who created the integration request. Read only.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LoggedMessage" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The logged message associated with the integration request after execution. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SourceLocationID" type="cis:IntegrationLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID code of the integration location used for upload. Mandatory for create and not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SourceScope" type="cis:IntegrationLocationNameType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The upload file name or job name depending on the upload source type. 
					Mandatory only when integration location used for upload is ILT_DIRECTORY and system provided.
					Not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RowProcessed" type="cis:LongType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The number of data rows processed for this request. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RowCompleted" type="cis:LongType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The number of data rows completed for this request. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RowFailed" type="cis:LongType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The number of data rows failed for this request. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FileProcessed" type="cis:UnsignedShortType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The number of files processed for this request. Read only.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="cis:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The division ID. Optional for create and not updateable.
				If not provided, the divison from the user is assumed.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LogisticsGroupCode" type="cis:LogisticGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The logistics group ID. Optional for create and not updateable.
				If not provided, the logistics group from the user is assumed.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CarrierCode" type="cis:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The carrier ID. Optional for create and not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CustomerCode" type="cis:CustomerCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The customer ID. Optional for create and not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationRequestOwner" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The integration batch request owner ID. If not provided, current API user is assumed.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="StartedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The date and time that the batch request started. Read only.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ProcessRowsSequentiallyFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicated if the input data rows will be processed sequentially. 
					Optional for create and not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ProcessOperationsSequentiallyFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicated if input operations will be processed sequentially. 
					i.e. All data rows for the same operation are processed sequentially. 
					This will only apply to source locations that allow multiple operations, such as Directory locations
					Optional for create and not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DisableCascadeDependencyFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Disables cascade dependency, where if a row fails its dependent rows will also fail. 
					i.e. All records that depend upon failed records will also be marked as failed 
					Optional for create and not updateable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="IntegrationLocationType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Integration Location information data upload utility.  
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationLocationID" type="cis:IntegrationLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			                The ID code of the Integration Location. Mandatory for create. Not updatable.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemProvidedFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Indicates whether the integration location is system provided or not. Read only.
					Updated or delete of the integration location is not allowed when this flag is true.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationLocationDescription" type="cis:IntegrationLocationDescriptionType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The description of the integration location.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationLocationTypeEnumVal" type="cis:IntegrationLocationTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The integration location type. Mandatory for Create.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Description for IntegrationLocationTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationLocationName" type="cis:IntegrationLocationNameType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The name of the integration location. Mandatory for Create.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationFormat" type="cis:IntegrationFormatDomainValueType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The integration location format. Mandatory for Create.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="IntegrationFormatDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Description for integrationFormat. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="InputFileExtension" type="cis:FileExtensionType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The input file extension. Conditional mandatory.
					Mandatory if integration location type is Directory and not system provided. Blank otherwise.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ProcessingFileExtension" type="cis:FileExtensionType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The processing file extension. Conditional mandatory.
					Mandatory if integration location type is Directory and not system provided. Blank otherwise.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CompletedFileExtension" type="cis:FileExtensionType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The completed file extension. Conditional mandatory.
					Mandatory if integration location type is Directory and not system provided. Blank otherwise.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FailedFileExtension" type="cis:FileExtensionType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The failed file extension. Conditional mandatory.
					Mandatory if integration location type is Directory and not system provided. Blank otherwise.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ResultFileExtension" type="cis:FileExtensionType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The result file extension. Conditional mandatory.
					Mandatory if integration location type is Directory and not system provided. Blank otherwise.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FileResultEnumVal" type="cis:FileResultEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The integration location file results. Mandatory for Create.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FileResultEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Description for fileResultEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="cis:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The division ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="MappingCode" type="cis:IntegrationMapCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The API mapping ID. Mandatory when integration location type is Table.
				Must be empty for system provided Integration Location.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			                The date and time that the integration location was created. Read only field.
		                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The date and time that the integration location was updated. Read only field.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The ID of the user who created the integration location. Read only field.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                			The ID of the user who updated the integration location. Read only field.
                		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="GeneralEventDataType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				General event data. It is used to generate General event.
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID uniquely identifies the Load. Mandatory if SystemShipmentID or SystemShipmentLegID or SystemTripID or SystemShipmentLegContainerID or SystemBookingID is not provided.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID uniquely identifies the Shipment. Mandatory if SystemLoadID or SystemShipmentLegID or SystemTripID or SystemShipmentLegContainerID or SystemBookingID is not provided
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentLegID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID uniquely identifies the Shipment Leg. Mandatory if SystemLoadID or systemShipmentID or SystemTripID or SystemShipmentLegContainerID or SystemBookingID is not provided
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemTripID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID uniquely identifies the Trip. Mandatory if SystemLoadID or systemShipmentID or systemShipmentLegID or SystemShipmentLegContainerID or SystemBookingID is not provided
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemShipmentLegContainerID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID uniquely identifies the Shipment Leg Container. Mandatory if SystemLoadID or systemShipmentID or systemShipmentLegID or systemTripID or SystemBookingID is not provided
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemBookingID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID uniquely identifies the Shipment Leg Container. Mandatory if SystemLoadID or systemShipmentID or systemShipmentLegID or systemTripID or systemShipmentLegContainerID is not provided
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EventDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The Event date and time.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EventSourceEnumVal" type="cis:EventSourceEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates the source of the event as originating from an application feed (i.e., UI or API) or a specific partner integration.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EventText" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Free form text associated with an event.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="AlertDataType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Generate Alert. To trigger an Alert of any Alert Category i.e., Notification, Overdue, Violation, Exception, External and General.
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="EntityID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					ID of the entity for which alert is generated. Mandatory.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AlertTypeCode" type="cis:AlertTypeCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The alert type ID associated with the alert. Mandatory.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AlertEntityTypeEnumVal" type="cis:AlertEntityTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    An enumerated value defining how the Entity ID should be identified. Mandatory. 
					   ALERTENTTYPE_SHIPMENT- Entity ID is identified as a Shipment ID;
					   ALERTENTTYPE_SHPM_LEG- Entity ID is identified as a Shipment Leg ID;
					   ALERTENTTYPE_LOAD - Entity ID is identified as a Load ID;
					   ALERTENTTYPE_STOP - Entity ID is identified as a Stop ID;
					   ALERTENTTYPE_TRIP   - Entity ID is identified as a Trip ID;
					   ALERTENTTYPE_DOCK_CMT- Entity ID is identified as a Dock Commitment ID;    
					   ALERTENTTYPE_BOOKING        - Entity ID is identified as a Booking ID;
					   ALERTENTTYPE_DRVR_ASGN-Entity ID is identified as a Asset Assignment ID.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AlertText" type="cis:AlertTextType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    free form text associated with an alert.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EscalationBasisDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The date/time field Should accept past and future dates. If not specified, then system date time should be used.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AlertSeverityEnumVal" type="cis:AlertSeverityEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The alert severity.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AlertSourceEnumVal" type="cis:ApiSourceEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    Indicates the source of the event as originating from an application feed (i.e., UI or API) or a specific partner integration.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="AddLoadsToTripDataType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				Information about loads to add to a trip/booking.
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemTripID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The ID of the trip/booking.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The IDs of the existing loads to be added to the trip/booking.
					At least 1 load is required.
					The sequence of loads added to the trip/booking corresponds to the sequence of Load IDs in the input.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="AppointmentOutputType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
			Details of the appointment process output.
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemAppointmentID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				The appointment ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AppointmentModifiedAfterSchedulingFlag" type="xsd:boolean" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
				Indicates whether the appointment is supposed to be deleted.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="AssetActivityType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
        The activity information of asset.
    </xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="Id" type="cis:IDType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemAssetActivityID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            An automatically generated system Asset Activity identifier. This is a read-only field.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AssetAssignmentID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The internally assigned unique identifier for the asset assignment this activity references.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActivitySourceEnumVal" type="cis:ApiSourceEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The source of the asset activity.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActivitySourceEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Description for ActivitySourceEnumVal. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AssetActivityTypeEnumVal" type="cis:AssetActivityTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            indicates the type of asset activity being reported.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AssetActivityTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Description for AssetActivityTypeVal. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RecordOfDutyStatusEnumVal" type="cis:RecordOfDutyStatusTypeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The Record of Duty Status (RODS) for the asset activity.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="RecordOfDutyStatusEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Description for RecordOfDutyStatusVal. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActivityEndFlagEnumVal" type="cis:BooleanEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Whether this record indicates the end of the activity. If it is not the end, it is the start of the activity.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActivityEndFlagEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Description for ActivityEndFlagVal. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ReportedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The reported date/time for the asset activity. Must be specified in time zone of system.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AssetID" type="cis:AssetCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The asset ID. Mandatory for Create, ignored otherwise unless it is used to uniquely identify an existing asset activity together with load ID / trip ID.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CarrierCode" type="cis:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The carrier ID of the associated load or trip. Read-only
            </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="EquipmentTypeCode" type="cis:EquipmentCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The equipment type of the associated load or trip. Read-only.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemLoadID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The system identifier of the load associated with the activity. Considered only for Create unless it is used to uniquely identify an existing load level asset activity together with optional asset ID. For Delete, multiple asset activities can be identified using SystemLoadID.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemTripID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The system identifier of the trip associated with the activity. Considered only for Create unless it is used to uniquely identify an existing trip level asset activity together with optional asset ID. For Delete, multiple asset activities can be identified using SystemTripID.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemStopID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The system identifier of the stop associated with the activity. Considered only for Create.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="StopNum" type="cis:UnsignedLongType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			     The stop number of the stop associated with the activity. Considered only for Create.
			</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ShippingLocationCode" type="cis:ShippingLocationCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The shipping location code at which the activity occurred. Optional. Not updateable. Both of shippingLocationCode and shippingLocationTypeEnumVal are optional, but if one is provided the other should be provided as well.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumVal" type="cis:ShipPointEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The shipping location type (load-at, consignee, hub or distribution center) at which the activity occurred. Optional. Not updateable. Both of shippingLocationCode and shippingLocationTypeEnumVal are optional, but if one is provided the other should be provided as well.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ShippingLocationTypeEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Description for shippingLocationTypeEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="City" type="cis:CityNameType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The city in which the activity occurred. Optional. Not updateable.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="State" type="cis:StateCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The state in which the activity occurred. Optional. Not updateable.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CountryCode" type="cis:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The country in which the activity occurred. Optional. Not updateable.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Latitude" type="cis:LatitudeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The latitude value for the location at which the activity occurred. Optional. Not updateable. Will be ignored if longitude is not supplied..
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Longitude" type="cis:LongitudeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The longitude value for the location at which the activity occurred. Optional. Not updateable. Will be ignored if latitude is not supplied.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="Odometer" type="cis:OdometerType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The odometer reading at the time of the activity. Expressed in DistanceUOM units of measure..
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DistanceUOMEnumVal" type="cis:DistanceUnitOfMeasureEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The units of measure the Odometer reading is expressed in.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DistanceUOMEnumDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			Description for distanceUOMEnumVal. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActivityChargeAmount" type="cis:DollarType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The charge amount for the activity. Expressed in the currency CurrencyCode. Used for activities which have an associated cost.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CurrencyCode" type="cis:CurrencyDomainValueType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The currency type that the ActivityChargeAmount is expressed in. Used for activities which have an associated cost.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CurrencyCodeDescr" type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			 Description for CurrencyCode. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ExchangeRate" type="cis:ExchangeRateType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			The calculated exchange rate at creation. Read-only.
		</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ActivityText" type="cis:ActivityTextType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            Free-form text associated with this activity. Optional.
            </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The date and time that the activity was created. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UpdatedDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The date and time that the activity was last updated. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CreatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The ID of the user who created the activity. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="UpdatedByUserCode" type="cis:UserCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The ID of the user who last updated the activity. Read-only.
        </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
            </xsd:complexType>
            <xsd:complexType name="AssetAssignmentType">
                <xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:documentation>
				The assignment information of the asset.
			</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:sequence>
                    <xsd:element name="Id" type="cis:IDType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Internal ID. Applicable only for UI-oriented APIs.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="SystemAssetAssignmentID" type="cis:KeyStringType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					An automatically generated system identifier for this asset assignment.
					Ignored for Create.
					Mandatory for other operations unless the asset assignment can be identified by load ID / trip ID and optional asset ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="AssetCode" type="cis:AssetCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The asset ID. Mandatory for Create,
					ignored otherwise unless it is used to uniquely identify an existing asset assignment together with load ID / trip ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CarrierCode" type="cis:CarrierCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The carrier ID for the asset assignment. Read-only.
					</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DivisionCode" type="cis:DivisionCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The division ID of the asset assignment. Mandatory for Create if the asset assignment is not associated with load or trip. Ignored for other operations.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LogisticsGroupCode" type="cis:LogisticGroupCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The logistics group ID of the asset assignment. Mandatory for Create if the asset assignment is not associated with load or trip. Ignored for other operations.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="ExternalCode" type="cis:ExternalXRefType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					An external identifying code.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="DomicileCode" type="cis:DomicileCodeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					The domicile ID.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
