            The system-calculated charge amount for the load. Expressed in the base system currency. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BaseChargedAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The charged amount for the load. Expressed in the base system currency. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="BaseDiscountAmount" type="cis:DollarWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
            The discount amount for the load. Expressed in the base system currency. Read-only. Available only through UI-oriented APIs.
                                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="FirstStopToTimeFromLoadStartTimeHours" type="cis:HoursWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    the computed value represents a duration (in hours) by which a load start date/time falls outside of shipment pickup windows on the first stop; a negative value indicates the load starts before at least one shipment pickup window; a positive value indicates the load starts after the end of at least one shipment pickup window; zero indicates the load starts within the pickup window for all shipments on the stop
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="LastStopToTimeFromLoadEndTimeHours" type="cis:HoursWithNegativeType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    the computed value represents a duration (in hours) by which a load end date/time falls outside of shipment delivery windows on the last stop; a negative value indicates the load ends before at least one shipment delivery window; a positive value indicates the load ends after the end of at least one shipment delivery window; zero indicates the load ends within the delivery window for all shipments on the last stop
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PreloadingStartDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The date and time when pre-loading started.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="PreloadingEndDateTime" type="xsd:dateTime" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
                    The date and time when pre-loading completed.
                </xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
