			Operation header.
			</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="CompatibilityMode" type="cis:UserProfileCompatibilityModeEnumValType" minOccurs="0">
                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
			User profile may be returned with some alteration when compatibility mode is TMWEBUI.
			For example, units of measurement and currency will be taken from carrier or customer if user is carrier or customer.
			This is consistent with behavior of TM Web UI. When compatibility mode is RAW the values are returned without changes.
			By default compatibility mode is TMWEBUI.
			</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
