                        <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation>
					Applicable to execution mode scheduling, and based on event reported date/time defines the minimum time that must elapse after a successful scheduling request before scheduling will be invoked again in reaction to a current location update or revised ETA.
				</xsd:documentation>
                        </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
