                    SI_ID - The shipments are identified by their IDs.
                    
                    SI_NUM - The shipments are identified by their shipment numbers.
                    
                    SI_RFRC - The shipments are identified by their reference numbers.
                    
                    SI_RFRC_DIV - The shipments are identified by their reference numbers and Division ID. If a user is not restricted to a division, then a division must be specified in the input. If a user is restricted to a division, then a division can be omitted or, if specified, should match the division to which the user is restricted.
                    
                    SI_TRKG_NUM - The shipments are identified by their shipment tracking number. This is ShipmentDescription in the ShipmentType structure.

